{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_28_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_28","textTraditional":"一、十有七年，春正月丙辰，公會齊侯、紀侯盟于黃。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_28_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_28","textTraditional":"二、二月丙午，公及邾婁儀父盟于趡。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_28_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_28","textTraditional":"三、五月丙午，及齊師戰于奚。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_28_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_28","textTraditional":"四、六月丁丑，蔡侯封人卒。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_28_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_28","textTraditional":"五、秋八月，蔡季自陳歸于蔡。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_28_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_28","textTraditional":"六、癸巳，葬蔡桓侯。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_28_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_28","textTraditional":"七、及宋人、衞人伐邾婁。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_28_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_28","textTraditional":"八、冬十月朔，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":8}],"overrides":{}}